[
  {
    "id": "trans_0",
    "start": 0,
    "end": 1.44,
    "text": "Lady Mo Rong, of the Shen clan,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_1",
    "start": 1.44,
    "end": 2.9,
    "text": "is granted the title of Shun,\nof the Cheng surname."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_2",
    "start": 2.9,
    "end": 4.18,
    "text": "Please accept this decree\nof gentleness and obedience."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_3",
    "start": 4.18,
    "end": 6.74,
    "text": "And by imperial decree, you are\nappointed as a First-Rank Mandated Lady."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_4",
    "start": 6.74,
    "end": 8.36,
    "text": "Your servant kowtows in\ngratitude for the imperial favor."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_5",
    "start": 9.12,
    "end": 9.96,
    "text": "Lady Mo Rong,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_6",
    "start": 9.96,
    "end": 11.16,
    "text": "please accept the decree."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_7",
    "start": 19.4,
    "end": 20.26,
    "text": "Guards!"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_8",
    "start": 20.26,
    "end": 22.16,
    "text": "Guards!"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_9",
    "start": 22.16,
    "end": 23.4,
    "text": "Guards!"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_10",
    "start": 31.4,
    "end": 32.06,
    "text": "Sister."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_11",
    "start": 33.78,
    "end": 34.22,
    "text": "Why?"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_12",
    "start": 34.22,
    "end": 35.7,
    "text": "Don't call me sister."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_13",
    "start": 35.7,
    "end": 36.64,
    "text": "You are not worthy."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_14",
    "start": 37.239,
    "end": 37.68,
    "text": "I..."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_15",
    "start": 39.879,
    "end": 41.16,
    "text": "We are both daughters of the Shen family."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_16",
    "start": 41.16,
    "end": 42.82,
    "text": "What are you blaming me for? Don't forget,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_17",
    "start": 42.82,
    "end": 43.92,
    "text": "three years ago, the one who received me"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_18",
    "start": 43.92,
    "end": 44.86,
    "text": "and begged for my hand was not weak."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_19",
    "start": 44.86,
    "end": 45.52,
    "text": "It would have been fine."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_20",
    "start": 45.52,
    "end": 46.78,
    "text": "You have no real brightness."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_21",
    "start": 47.36,
    "end": 48.72,
    "text": "In truth, it's all pretense."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_22",
    "start": 50.019,
    "end": 50.9,
    "text": "Who is together with you?"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_23",
    "start": 50.9,
    "end": 52.38,
    "text": "You, just die."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_24",
    "start": 61.4,
    "end": 63.08,
    "text": "If I had another chance,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_25",
    "start": 63.08,
    "end": 65,
    "text": "I would rather not describe you this way."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_26",
    "start": 67.94,
    "end": 69.22,
    "text": "What time is it now?"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_27",
    "start": 69.22,
    "end": 70.36,
    "text": "Still sleeping and snoring here?"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_28",
    "start": 70.36,
    "end": 70.82,
    "text": "You..."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_29",
    "start": 70.82,
    "end": 71.68,
    "text": "Master."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_30",
    "start": 71.68,
    "end": 73.38,
    "text": "The sons of the royal and noble families,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_31",
    "start": 73.38,
    "end": 74.8,
    "text": "I heard that the Shen family is\nchoosing a husband for their daughter."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_32",
    "start": 74.8,
    "end": 76.06,
    "text": "They are all coming to\ncompete for the betrothal."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_33",
    "start": 76.06,
    "end": 77.6,
    "text": "Look at you, still sleeping here."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_34",
    "start": 77.6,
    "end": 79.1,
    "text": "You don't act like a young lady at all."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_35",
    "start": 79.1,
    "end": 80.02,
    "text": "Let me tell you,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_36",
    "start": 80.02,
    "end": 81.34,
    "text": "You and Qiao'er must handle the betrothal."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_37",
    "start": 81.34,
    "end": 82.28,
    "text": "You need to choose carefully."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_38",
    "start": 82.28,
    "end": 83.28,
    "text": "Whoever offers the best price,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_39",
    "start": 83.28,
    "end": 84.62,
    "text": "That person will be the\nShen family's son-in-law."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_40",
    "start": 84.62,
    "end": 85.74,
    "text": "Don't let me down."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_41",
    "start": 88.82,
    "end": 90.98,
    "text": "Wasn't I just dragged here?"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_42",
    "start": 97.94,
    "end": 99.48,
    "text": "I've been reborn"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_43",
    "start": 99.48,
    "end": 100.82,
    "text": "back to three years ago"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_44",
    "start": 100.82,
    "end": 102.64,
    "text": "the day of the embroidered\nball husband selection"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_45",
    "start": 104.52,
    "end": 106.72,
    "text": "Miss, it's your turn to\nthrow the embroidered ball"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_46",
    "start": 108.74,
    "end": 109.66,
    "text": "Shen Yunqiao"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_47",
    "start": 110.8,
    "end": 111.58,
    "text": "Sister"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_48",
    "start": 111.58,
    "end": 113.24,
    "text": "Can't let me lie down first"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_49",
    "start": 113.24,
    "end": 114.6,
    "text": "It's Shen Yunqiao"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_50",
    "start": 114.6,
    "end": 115.8,
    "text": "She, to make me throw\nthe embroidered ball first"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_51",
    "start": 115.8,
    "end": 117.02,
    "text": "is pushing me in every way"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_52",
    "start": 117.94,
    "end": 118.76,
    "text": "Now"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_53",
    "start": 119.46,
    "end": 121.8,
    "text": "It seems Shen Yunqiao has also been reborn"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_54",
    "start": 121.8,
    "end": 122.28,
    "text": "Fine"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_55",
    "start": 122.28,
    "end": 123.62,
    "text": "You go first"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_56",
    "start": 124.539,
    "end": 124.94,
    "text": "Give it to me"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_57",
    "start": 125.88,
    "end": 126.28,
    "text": "Give it to me"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_58",
    "start": 126.28,
    "end": 126.6,
    "text": "Give it to me"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_59",
    "start": 126.6,
    "end": 128.479,
    "text": "Whoever thinks of it"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_60",
    "start": 128.479,
    "end": 129.16,
    "text": "Whoever thinks of it"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_61",
    "start": 129.16,
    "end": 129.44,
    "text": "Give it to me"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_62",
    "start": 129.96,
    "end": 130.36,
    "text": "Give it to me"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_63",
    "start": 130.36,
    "end": 130.56,
    "text": "Give it to me"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_64",
    "start": 137.38,
    "end": 138.44,
    "text": "In this life"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_65",
    "start": 138.44,
    "end": 139.82,
    "text": "the one who marries Murong An"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_66",
    "start": 139.82,
    "end": 140.68,
    "text": "can only be me"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_67",
    "start": 147.7,
    "end": 148.02,
    "text": "Murong An"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_68",
    "start": 148.02,
    "end": 148.6,
    "text": "My lord, look quickly!"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_69",
    "start": 148.6,
    "end": 149.48,
    "text": "He accepted the proposal!"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_70",
    "start": 149.48,
    "end": 150.66,
    "text": "But it's the second young\nmaster of the Murong family!"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_71",
    "start": 150.66,
    "end": 151.36,
    "text": "It's her."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_72",
    "start": 151.7,
    "end": 153.3,
    "text": "It's Murong An, the second\nyoung master of the Murong family."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_73",
    "start": 153.3,
    "end": 155.08,
    "text": "The Murong family is the\nemperor's trusted right hand."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_74",
    "start": 155.08,
    "end": 156.22,
    "text": "The eldest young master, Murong He,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_75",
    "start": 156.22,
    "end": 158.18,
    "text": "was just appointed as the Grand\nMarshal's deputy a few days ago."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_76",
    "start": 158.54,
    "end": 159.36,
    "text": "If the Shen family"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_77",
    "start": 159.36,
    "end": 160.56,
    "text": "can form a marriage alliance\nwith the Murong family,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_78",
    "start": 160.56,
    "end": 162.18,
    "text": "we'll soon become relatives\nof the imperial family!"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_79",
    "start": 162.56,
    "end": 163.42,
    "text": "Murong An..."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_80",
    "start": 164.28,
    "end": 164.92,
    "text": "In this life,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_81",
    "start": 164.92,
    "end": 166.44,
    "text": "I have finally changed my fate."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_82",
    "start": 166.88,
    "end": 169.08,
    "text": "Three years later, Murong An's\nentire family was thrown into prison."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_83",
    "start": 169.08,
    "end": 169.94,
    "text": "And I..."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_84",
    "start": 169.94,
    "end": 171.94,
    "text": "will become a noble, titled lady."
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_85",
    "start": 171.94,
    "end": 173.48,
    "text": "Shen Yunqiao, oh Shen Yunqiao,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_86",
    "start": 173.48,
    "end": 174.78,
    "text": "you exhausted all your schemes,"
  },
  {
    "id": "trans_87",
    "start": 174.78,
    "end": 176.7,
    "text": "but you don't know you've\nstepped right into a wolf's den."
  }
]